<title>USA: Cavco names Brent Ghelfi president, CEO.</title>
<headline>Cavco names Brent Ghelfi president, CEO.</headline>
<dateline>PHOENIX 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Cavco Industries Inc said Brent Ghelfi had been appointed president and chief executive officer of the company.  </p>
<p>Cavco said in a statement Ghelfi had served as the company's vice president and chief operating officer. He had also been president of its Sun Built Homes Inc, it said.</p>
<p>Cavco, which makes manucfactured homes, did not say who Ghelfi would replace.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
</text>
